{"id":2346,"date":"2024-09-19T12:35:47","date_gmt":"2024-09-19T12:35:47","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/shopcardboardboxes.com\/?post_type=product&#038;p=2346"},"modified":"2025-10-02T11:18:40","modified_gmt":"2025-10-02T11:18:40","slug":"fancy-cardboard-boxes","status":"publish","type":"product","link":"https:\/\/shopcardboardboxes.com\/product\/fancy-cardboard-boxes\/","title":{"rendered":"Fancy Cardboard Boxes"},"content":{"rendered":"<h2>Stylish Packaging That Combines Strength and Elegance<\/h2>\n<p>Looking for stylish and secure packaging for your premium items? At <a href=\"https:\/\/shopcardboardboxes.com\/\"><strong><em>Shop Cardboard Boxes<\/em><\/strong><\/a>, we offer custom <strong>fancy cardboard boxes<\/strong> designed to suit a variety of business and gifting needs. These boxes combine strength, customization, and a refined appearance\u2014making them ideal for brands that want to leave a lasting impression.<\/p>\n<p>Whether you&#8217;re shipping retail products, creating influencer mailers, or organizing luxury gifts, our packaging delivers on both appearance and performance. With full design flexibility, we provide <strong>fancy cardboard boxes wholesale<\/strong> that meet your expectations without overspending.<\/p>\n<hr \/>\n<h2>Elegant Designs for Fancy Packaging Solutions<\/h2>\n<h3>Custom Options for Every Industry<\/h3>\n<p>Our <strong>fancy cardboard boxes with lids<\/strong> are widely used across retail, cosmetics, apparel, tech accessories, and promotional kits. Each box can be built in your desired shape, size, and finish.<\/p>\n<ul>\n<li>Choose two-piece boxes, sleeve boxes, or hinged lid styles<\/li>\n<li>Add inserts to secure your items inside<\/li>\n<li>Select from white, black, or colored stock<\/li>\n<li>Design interiors with printed patterns or messages<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<h3>Material and Structure That Supports Quality<\/h3>\n<p>All boxes are made from high-quality boards that maintain structure while adding a premium touch. You can select the right base material depending on your product weight and delivery method.<\/p>\n<ul>\n<li>Corrugated board for strength and protection<\/li>\n<li>Rigid chipboard for a polished, luxury appearance<\/li>\n<li>Eco Kraft for a clean, natural look<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<table style=\"height: 344px;\" width=\"930\">\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th><strong>Feature<\/strong><\/th>\n<th><strong>Description<\/strong><\/th>\n<\/tr>\n<\/thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>Sizes<\/td>\n<td>Custom Dimensions (Small to Large)<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Material Options<\/td>\n<td>Corrugated, Rigid Chipboard, Eco Kraft, White SBS<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Printing Options<\/td>\n<td>CMYK, PMS, Foil, Embossing, Raised Ink<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Coating Options<\/td>\n<td>Gloss, Matte, Spot UV<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Lid Types<\/td>\n<td>Two-Piece, Hinged, Magnetic, Flip Top<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Inserts<\/td>\n<td>Foam, Die-Cut Cardboard, Paper Dividers<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Quantity Range<\/td>\n<td>100 \u2013 500,000 Units<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Proof Options<\/td>\n<td>3D Mock-up, Flat View, Physical Sample (On Request)<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Turnaround Time<\/td>\n<td>4\u20136 Business Days, Rush Available<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Shipping<\/td>\n<td>Free Nationwide Shipping<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Support<\/td>\n<td>Free Design Support with Every Order<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<\/tbody>\n<\/table>\n<hr \/>\n<h2>Fancy Shipping Boxes That Stand Out<\/h2>\n<h3>Packaging That Travels and Impresses<\/h3>\n<p>When sending premium goods, packaging should do more than protect\u2014it should represent your brand. Our <strong>fancy shipping boxes<\/strong> are built with design and durability in mind, offering protection without sacrificing style.<\/p>\n<ul>\n<li>Secure closure with added visual appeal<\/li>\n<li>Custom inserts to reduce internal movement<\/li>\n<li>Options for branded messaging on interior and exterior<\/li>\n<li>Available in foldable styles to save space in storage<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p>For brands working in beauty, wellness, or gifting, these boxes pair seamlessly with other packaging formats designed for presentation and customer experience. Our range of <a class=\"cursor-pointer\" href=\"https:\/\/shopcardboardboxes.com\/product-category\/Cosmetic-and-Gift-Cardboard-Boxes\/\" target=\"_new\" rel=\"noopener\" data-start=\"394\" data-end=\"517\"><strong data-start=\"395\" data-end=\"432\">Cosmetic and Gift Cardboard Boxes<\/strong><\/a> includes packaging solutions for items like skincare kits, perfume bottles, makeup palettes, and gift sets, helping you maintain a consistent and polished packaging strategy across your product line.<\/p>\n<h3>Perfect for Promotions and Retail Display<\/h3>\n<p>If you run a subscription box, influencer campaign, or retail promotion, <strong>fancy packaging<\/strong> adds value to the unboxing moment.<\/p>\n<ul>\n<li>Display boxes for cosmetics, perfumes, and candles<\/li>\n<li>Magnetic closures for sleek presentation<\/li>\n<li>Printed liners and ribbons for added experience<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<hr \/>\n<h2>Customization and Finishing Options<\/h2>\n<h3>Make Your Brand Memorable<\/h3>\n<p>Custom finishes and features allow you to match packaging with your branding goals. Whether you prefer a bold glossy design or something more understated, we provide options to suit.<\/p>\n<ul>\n<li>Gloss coating for vibrant surface appearance<\/li>\n<li>Matte coating for a smooth, classic finish<\/li>\n<li>Spot UV to highlight logos or names<\/li>\n<li>Foil stamping in gold or silver<\/li>\n<li>Raised ink and embossing for tactile effects<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<hr \/>\n<h2>Why Choose Fancy Cardboard Boxes Wholesale<\/h2>\n<h3>Benefits of Ordering in Bulk<\/h3>\n<p>Choosing <strong>fancy cardboard boxes wholesale<\/strong> helps businesses maintain consistent packaging while lowering costs. It\u2019s an ideal solution for growing brands, eCommerce sellers, and seasonal campaigns.<\/p>\n<ol>\n<li>Reduce per-unit cost on high-volume orders<\/li>\n<li>Maintain packaging consistency across product lines<\/li>\n<li>Ensure supply for busy retail seasons<\/li>\n<li>Simplify planning and inventory management<\/li>\n<\/ol>\n<h3>Tailored to Your Business Goals<\/h3>\n<p>No matter your industry or order size, we offer the same level of care and customization. Whether you\u2019re preparing 100 gift sets or 100,000 product boxes, our team ensures quality from design to delivery.<\/p>\n<hr \/>\n<h2>Order Your Fancy Cardboard Boxes in Simple Steps<\/h2>\n<h3>How to Get Started<\/h3>\n<ol>\n<li>Share your product dimensions and quantity<\/li>\n<li>Select box style, lid type, and insert options<\/li>\n<li>Upload your branding or request free design help<\/li>\n<li>Review 3D digital proof or request a physical sample<\/li>\n<li>Approve your layout<\/li>\n<li>Receive boxes with free nationwide shipping<\/li>\n<\/ol>\n<p>If you&#8217;re looking to coordinate packaging for smaller retail items or handmade goods, our <a class=\"\" href=\"https:\/\/shopcardboardboxes.com\/product\/cardboard-soap-boxes\/\" target=\"_new\" rel=\"noopener\" data-start=\"361\" data-end=\"449\"><strong data-start=\"362\" data-end=\"386\">Cardboard Soap Boxes<\/strong><\/a> are a popular match with fancy gift boxes, especially for bath, skincare, and artisan products.<\/p>\n<hr \/>\n<h2>Why Shop Cardboard Boxes is Your Go-To Source<\/h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Custom fancy cardboard boxes with lids and inserts<\/li>\n<li>Full color printing and premium finishing<\/li>\n<li>Coating options like Gloss, Matte, and Spot UV<\/li>\n<li>Free layout design support<\/li>\n<li>Fast production and rush delivery available<\/li>\n<li>Free shipping across the country<\/li>\n<li>Packaging suited for gifting, retail, and shipping<\/li>\n<li>Eco-friendly materials available upon request<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n","protected":false},"excerpt":{"rendered":"<p>Shop Cardboard Boxes offers Fancy Cardboard Boxes at wholesale prices. We offer coating options: Gloss, Matte, Spot UV, free design &amp; shipping. Custom sizes &amp; styles available. fast turnaround times. High-quality material &amp; printing options. Add a touch of luxury to your products with our stylish cardboard boxes. Order Now.<\/p>\n","protected":false},"featured_media":2466,"template":"","meta":{"_joinchat":[]},"product_brand":[],"product_cat":[184],"product_tag":[],"class_list":["post-2346","product","type-product","status-publish","has-post-thumbnail","product_cat-cosmetic-and-gift-cardboard-boxes","rishi-post","first","instock","shipping-taxable","purchasable","product-type-simple"],"yoast_head":"<!-- This site is optimized with the Yoast SEO plugin v27.9 - https:\/\/yoast.com\/product\/yoast-seo-wordpress\/ -->\n<title>Get Fancy Cardboard Boxes &amp; Packaging<\/title>\n<meta name=\"description\" content=\"Elegant, customizable cardboard boxes for packaging your precious items. Perfect for gifts, jewelry, and more. Order today.\" \/>\n<meta name=\"robots\" content=\"index, follow, max-snippet:-1, max-image-preview:large, max-video-preview:-1\" \/>\n<link rel=\"canonical\" href=\"https:\/\/shopcardboardboxes.com\/product\/fancy-cardboard-boxes\/\" \/>\n<meta property=\"og:locale\" content=\"en_US\" \/>\n<meta property=\"og:type\" content=\"article\" \/>\n<meta property=\"og:title\" content=\"Get Fancy Cardboard Boxes &amp; Packaging\" \/>\n<meta property=\"og:description\" content=\"Elegant, customizable cardboard boxes for packaging your precious items. Perfect for gifts, jewelry, and more. Order today.\" \/>\n<meta property=\"og:url\" content=\"https:\/\/shopcardboardboxes.com\/product\/fancy-cardboard-boxes\/\" \/>\n<meta property=\"og:site_name\" content=\"Shop Cardboard Boxes\" \/>\n<meta property=\"article:modified_time\" content=\"2025-10-02T11:18:40+00:00\" \/>\n<meta property=\"og:image\" content=\"https:\/\/shopcardboardboxes.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/09\/Fancy-Cardboard-Boxes-1.jpg\" \/>\n\t<meta property=\"og:image:width\" content=\"1200\" \/>\n\t<meta property=\"